body=list_items([('先核对年龄、英语及课程条件；未满15岁不能注册本科或非学分课程。','First verify age, English and course conditions; under-15s cannot enroll for undergraduate or noncredit study.'),('建立 MyDCE／DCEKey 账户，完成当学期的预注册信息。','Create a MyDCE/DCEKey account and complete term preregistration.'),('查找 PSYC E-15；2027春季 CRN 23862，2026秋季 CRN 10232。','Find PSYC E-15; Spring 2027 CRN 23862, Fall 2026 CRN 10232.'),('选择本科或非学分选项，加入选课车，再提交正式注册；仅加购物车不等于注册成功。','Choose undergraduate or noncredit study, add the course, then submit registration; adding to a cart alone is insufficient.'),('按截止时间付款，核对注册确认，领取／设置 HarvardKey，再进入 Canvas 与 Zoom。','Pay by the deadline, verify registration confirmation, claim/set up HarvardKey, then access Canvas and Zoom.')],True)+p('单门公开课程一般不需要学位入学申请，但仍必须满足注册资格。进一步核实可联系 Enrollment Services：info@dce.harvard.edu，+1 617-495-4024。','Public individual courses generally do not require a degree-admission application, but enrollment requirements still apply. Eligibility contact: Enrollment Services, info@dce.harvard.edu, +1 617-495-4024.')+source('https://extension.harvard.edu/registration-admissions/course-registration/','MyDCE 官方注册步骤','Official MyDCE registration steps')
parts.append(details('PSYC E-15：注册操作流程','PSYC E-15: registration workflow',body))

body=p('2027春季周四5:30–7:30pm美东，对应洛杉矶2:30–4:30pm。课程允许按规定选择 Zoom 直播或录像；录像通常在当天或下一个工作日提供。异步不等于没有每周截止。','Spring 2027 meetings are Thursdays 5:30–7:30pm Eastern, or 2:30–4:30pm Los Angeles. The course permits Zoom or recordings under its rules; recordings are generally available the same or next business day. Asynchronous study still has weekly deadlines.')+p('直播需要稳定网络、电脑、摄像头和麦克风；不适合在途中用手机参加。Extension 建议每1小时课堂至少预留2小时课外学习，因此可先按每周6小时以上规划，实际以作业量为准。','Live participation requires stable internet, a computer, camera and microphone; joining by phone while traveling is unsuitable. Extension suggests at least two outside study hours per class hour, so allow at least six hours/week initially and adjust to the workload.')+source('https://coursebrowser.dce.harvard.edu/course/introduction-to-psychology-3/','春季课程形式与时间','Spring format & schedule')+source('https://extension.harvard.edu/about/faq/','Extension 学习投入 FAQ','Extension workload FAQ')
parts.append(details('PSYC E-15：直播、录像、时区与设备','PSYC E-15: live class, recordings, time zones & equipment',body))

graderows=[('数据项目1','Data project 1','20%','2026-09-24'),('期中考试','Midterm','15%','2026-10-15'),('数据项目2','Data project 2','20%','2026-11-12'),('6次作业合计','Six homework assignments combined','10%',t('按课内安排','In-course schedule')),('期末考试','Final exam','35%','2026-12-17')]
body=p('以下来自2026秋季公开 syllabus，作为工作量示例，不能把这些作业日期直接套用到2027春季。','The following comes from the public Fall 2026 syllabus as a workload example. These assignment dates do not apply automatically to Spring 2027.')+table([('评估','Assessment'),('比重','Weight'),('日期','Date')],[[t(z,e),weight,date] for z,e,weight,date in graderows],('2026秋季评分结构','Fall 2026 grading structure'))+p('秋季期中是90分钟开卷、可用笔记，须在10月15日00:01–23:59美东的窗口内完成。看录像者应在下次直播前跟上内容与作业；不记录出勤不代表没有学习责任。','The fall midterm is a 90-minute open-book/open-note exam within the October 15, 00:01–23:59 Eastern window. Recording viewers should catch up before the next live class; unrecorded attendance does not remove learning responsibilities.')+p('非学分学生可以听课和讨论，但不提交作业、论文或考试，不评分。因此，如果目标是批改反馈或正式成绩，应先理解两种注册选项的区别。','Noncredit students may attend and discuss but do not submit homework, papers or exams and receive no grade. Consider that distinction when seeking assessed work or formal grades.')+source('https://harvard.simplesyllabus.com/en-US/doc/zd5mwcoob','PSYC E-15：2026秋季公开 syllabus','PSYC E-15: public Fall 2026 syllabus')
parts.append(details('PSYC E-15：作业、考试与非学分限制','PSYC E-15: assignments, exams & noncredit limitations',body))

body=p('英语为母语者无需提交英语能力证明；学校将母语定义为最先学会读、写、理解和说的语言。其他学生可提交合格成绩单或考试成绩。仅在英语学校就读不一定自动豁免。','Native English speakers need no proficiency evidence; Harvard defines native language as the first learned for reading, writing, understanding and speaking. Others may use qualifying transcripts or test scores. Attendance at an English-medium school alone does not automatically establish an exemption.')+p('成绩单路线需要已获得高中毕业文凭或大学学位，并显示在授予该资格、以英语教学的学校至少学习一年；在读、尚未授予的资格不接受。考试成绩须在两年内且可验证。','The transcript route requires an awarded high-school diploma or university degree, plus at least one year at the awarding English-medium institution. In-progress qualifications are insufficient. Test scores must be verifiable and no more than two years old.')+table([('考试','Test'),('最低要求','Minimum')],[[E('TOEFL iBT'),t('新制5.0/6；或旧制100/120','New scale 5.0/6; or legacy 100/120')],[E('IELTS Academic'),'7.0'],[E('PTE Academic'),'70'],[E('Duolingo English Test'),'125']],('Extension 英语成绩要求','Extension English test requirements'))+p('通过 MyDCE 的 Document Uploader 上传材料并查看审核状态；2027春季材料截止1月12日，尽量在注册开始前完成。','Upload evidence through MyDCE’s Document Uploader and check approval status. The Spring 2027 deadline is January 12; aim to complete this before registration opens.')+source('https://extension.harvard.edu/registration-admissions/course-registration/english-proficiency-requirement/','完整英语政策、豁免与上传说明','Full English policy, exemptions & upload instructions')
parts.append(details('PSYC E-15：英语要求与材料','PSYC E-15: English proficiency & documentation',body))

body=p('普通 HBS Online Certificate Courses 当前无需提交传统入学申请，通常是建立账户、选择开课期、填写注册信息并付款；但18+和英语要求仍适用。Credential Programs 的申请流程可能不同。','Ordinary HBS Online Certificate Courses currently use account creation, course/date selection, enrollment details and payment rather than a traditional application. The 18+ and English requirements still apply. Credential Programs may use a different application process.')+p('“Harvard 教授授课”“使用 HBS 平台”“HarvardX 证书”和“HBS Online 签发”是不同事实。上方课程卡分别注明提供单位和证书性质。','A Harvard instructor, the HBS learning platform, a HarvardX certificate and an HBS Online-issued credential describe different facts. Each course above identifies its provider and credential.')+source('https://online.hbs.edu/help/faqs/enrollment','HBS Online 注册 FAQ','HBS Online enrollment FAQ')+source('https://online.hbs.edu/legal/terms-of-use','HBS Online 使用条款','HBS Online terms')
parts.append(details('HBS Online：怎样注册、谁签发证书','HBS Online: enrollment and certificate issuer',body))
parts.append('</section>')

parts.append(section('plan','06','Amy 可以怎样开始','A practical start for Amy',('这是建议节奏，不是学校规定，也不需要同时报名全部课程。','This is a suggested pace, not a school requirement; there is no need to enroll in everything.')))
parts.append('<div class="path">')
stages=[('01','先用一周判断兴趣','Use a week to check the fit','观看 APA 决策课或 Wesleyan 社会心理学的可用预览；若希望先有全貌，试 Yale 导论。记录最想继续追问的3个问题。','Try an available preview from APA’s decision course or Wesleyan’s social psychology. For a broader map, try Yale’s introduction. Write three questions worth pursuing.'),('02','完成一门主课','Complete one main course','偏向情绪与偏差：先做 APA，约3–4周。偏向人际影响：选 Wesleyan，约8–10周。若选 Yale 基础课，可按6–8周学习。','For emotion and bias, start with APA over 3–4 weeks. For social influence, choose Wesleyan over 8–10 weeks. Yale’s foundation can be spread over 6–8 weeks.'),('03','再练习实际沟通','Then practice communication','选择 Yale 谈判心理学作为短课补充。以家庭活动、社团项目或时间分配为例，练习说明需求、询问对方重点和提出双方都能接受的方案。','Use Yale’s negotiation course as a short follow-up. With family plans, club projects or scheduling, practice stating needs, asking about priorities and proposing mutually acceptable options.'),('04','考虑下一次暑期直播','Consider a future live summer program','如果 Amy 喜欢讨论、研究项目和教师反馈，再关注 Stanford 下一期。等2027规则公布后核对资格与费用。','If Amy enjoys discussion, research projects and instructor feedback, consider the next Stanford cycle. Check eligibility and fees when 2027 rules appear.')]
for n,z,e,dz,de in stages:
    parts.append('<article><span class="path-number">'+n+'</span><div>'+t(z,e,'h3')+p(dz,de)+'</div></article>')
parts.append('</div><div class="practice">'+t('每周一页“为什么这样选择”笔记','A weekly one-page “Why this choice?” note','h3')+list_items([('发生了什么？只写看得到的行为，不替别人断言内心动机。','What happened? Describe observable behavior without assuming another person’s hidden motives.'),('可能的解释是什么？分别考虑信息、目标、情绪、习惯和社会情境。','What could explain it? Consider information, goals, emotion, habits and social context.'),('还有其他解释吗？哪一条证据会让我改变看法？','What is another explanation? What evidence would change my view?'),('如果要沟通：对方重视什么？我能怎样诚实说明理由，并保留对方拒绝的空间？','For communication: what matters to the other person? How can I explain honestly while leaving room for them to decline?')])+p('这些是个人学习练习。与他人一起做活动时先征得同意，不需要秘密测试同学。','These are personal learning exercises. Get agreement for shared activities; there is no need to secretly test classmates.','small-note')+'</div></section>')

parts.append(section('credentials','07','证书到底证明什么','What the certificate actually establishes'))
