parts.append(p('这些结业证书可以记录学习成果，但不等同于大学录取、学位、校友身份或心理学执业资格。作品集可以准确写：“完成 [提供方] 在 [平台] 的 [课程名称]，并通过测评。”','Completion certificates document learning; they do not establish university admission, a degree, alumni status or psychology licensure. A precise portfolio entry is: “Completed [course] from [provider] on [platform], including required assessments.”'))
