parts.append('<div class="source-method">'+t('来源与核查范围','Sources & verification scope','h3')+p('优先采用学校、课程平台和学会的官方页面。每张课程卡都附直接来源与报名入口。所有价格、开课日期和资格均为2026年9月7日核查快照；只看到旧年度资料的项目已注明年份。','Sources prioritize official universities, platforms and the professional association. Each course entry links directly to its evidence and enrollment page. Prices, dates and eligibility are a September 7, 2026 snapshot; older-cycle information is labeled.')+p('未替 Amy 建立账户、报名或付款。未登录才能看到的价格、课内及格分数与个人资格审批，没有用猜测填补。自定进度建议与课程契合度是本指南的判断。','No account, enrollment or payment was made for Amy. Account-specific prices, hidden passing thresholds and individual eligibility approvals are not assumed. Suggested pacing and subject-fit recommendations are this guide’s judgments.')+'</div>')
